# 09 Specifications — Prospect PAL

## APIs

### Workflow API

```typescript
// POST /api/workflows
interface CreateWorkflowRequest {
  name: string;
  description?: string;
  nodes: WorkflowNode[];
  connections: Connection[];
  credentials?: CredentialRef[];
}

// GET /api/workflows/[id]/execution
interface WorkflowExecution {
  id: string;
  workflowId: string;
  status: 'success' | 'error' | 'running' | 'waiting';
  startedAt: string;
  finishedAt?: string;
  nodeRuns: NodeRun[];
}

// POST /api/workflows/[id]/analyze
interface AnalyzeRequest {
  json: string; // n8n JSON
}

interface AnalyzeResponse {
  issues: Issue[];
  score: number; // 0-100
  suggestions: Suggestion[];
}
```

### AI API

```typescript
// POST /api/ai/build
interface AIBuildRequest {
  prompt: string;
  context?: string; // optional constraints
}

interface AIBuildResponse {
  workflow: Workflow;
  explanation: string;
}

// POST /api/ai/fix
interface AIFixRequest {
  brokenJson: string;
  error?: string;
}

interface AIFixResponse {
  fixedJson: string;
  fixedNodes: number;
  explanation: string;
}

// POST /api/ai/analyze-execution
interface ExecutionAnalysisRequest {
  executions: Execution[];
}

interface ExecutionAnalysisResponse {
  summary: string;
  failingWorkflows: string[];
  report: ReportData;
}
```

### Template API

```typescript
// GET /api/templates
interface ListTemplatesRequest {
  category?: string;
  search?: string;
  limit?: number;
  offset?: number;
}

interface Template {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  description: string;
  category: string;
  tags: string[];
  nodeTypes: string[];
  usageCount: number;
  json: any;
}
```

## SLOs

| Feature | P50 | P99 | Target |
|---------|-----|-----|--------|
| Page load | 800ms | 2s | P99 < 2s |
| AI build | 15s | 45s | P99 < 60s |
| Analyze JSON | 2s | 5s | P99 < 10s |
| Dashboard data | 500ms | 1.5s | P99 < 2s |
| Export | 1s | 3s | P99 < 5s |

## Threat Model

| Threat | Mitigation |
|--------|------------|
| Workflow JSON injection | Parse → validate schema → sanitize |
| Credential exposure | Encrypt at rest, never log, access audit |
| Rate limit AI costs | Per-user rate limits, burst protection |
| API key theft | Short-lived tokens, rotation |
| XSS in JSON preview | HTML escape, sanitize Markdown |

## Data Classification

| Data | Class | Storage |
|------|-------|---------|
| Workflow JSON | Internal | Encrypted DB |
| Credentials | Confidential | KMS + DB |
| Execution data | Internal | Encrypted DB, 90d retention |
| User PII | Confidential | Encrypted DB |
| AI prompts | Internal | Not logged (opt-in analytics) |
